(5870695, 854584, 39850, '<td valign="top">9 - Exquisite clarity and light and they really pop against the gray background.  Some sensor dust/something upper left.  The crop/framing is really good.  I wonder about a little more off each side, but that is likely ''another image'' - and your call anyway.</td>', '9 - Exquisite clarity and light and they really pop against the gray background.  Some sensor dust/something upper left.  The crop/framing is really good.  I wonder about a little more off each side, but that is likely ''another image'' - and your call anyway.', '2010-02-17 06:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5870697, 854687, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Beautiful scene.  Well captured and I like the depth.  I wonder why you chose the crop you did - my first thought was a centered composition, much tighter on the left, etc - but I appreciate that this may be your preference - and it <i>does</i> work.  The upper left ''something'' coming in perhaps cropped out though, just for further refinement.</td>', '6 - Beautiful scene.  Well captured and I like the depth.  I wonder why you chose the crop you did - my first thought was a centered composition, much tighter on the left, etc - but I appreciate that this may be your preference - and it does work.  The upper left ''something'' coming in perhaps cropped out though, just for further refinement.', '2010-02-17 06:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5870754, 854034, 111123, '<td valign="top">This is a very beautiful picture!</td>', 'This is a very beautiful picture!', '2010-02-17 07:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5870771, 853926, 43774, '<td valign="top">A nice waterfalls and I like the people at the top, it gives a sense of scale. Good composition too with the waterfalls to the side. The waterfalls is a bit overexposed though, some of the whites are blown out. A filter might have helped here.</td>', 'A nice waterfalls and I like the people at the top, it gives a sense of scale. Good composition too with the waterfalls to the side. The waterfalls is a bit overexposed though, some of the whites are blown out. A filter might have helped here.', '2010-02-17 08:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5870773, 854756, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, good composition. It''s a bit dark for my tastes and there''s some grain in the sky. I also see several dust spots, you can clone them out in basic.</td>', 'Nice photo, good composition. It''s a bit dark for my tastes and there''s some grain in the sky. I also see several dust spots, you can clone them out in basic.', '2010-02-17 08:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
