(5871116, 854722, 46885, '<td valign="top">Assuming you are the taxidermist, indeed a fascinating thing you made, and with good lighting, but compositionwise there''s some work to be done.</td>', 'Assuming you are the taxidermist, indeed a fascinating thing you made, and with good lighting, but compositionwise there''s some work to be done.', '2010-02-17 14:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
