(5871122, 854650, 46885, '<td valign="top">Convention holds it that man is not normally assumed made by Nature. I know that''s highly arguable in the academic sense, but the lovely pair and all man-made clothing they piled on themselves sort of don''t fit the theme.</td>', 'Convention holds it that man is not normally assumed made by Nature. I know that''s highly arguable in the academic sense, but the lovely pair and all man-made clothing they piled on themselves sort of don''t fit the theme.', '2010-02-17 14:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
