(5871128, 854201, 46885, '<td valign="top">Did she die in some sort of nuclear accident? If not, why this weird inversion? Or was it not? A bit tighter crop and the symmetry of ribs would look really good, but the weird light/shadow relationship still bugs me.</td>', 'Did she die in some sort of nuclear accident? If not, why this weird inversion? Or was it not? A bit tighter crop and the symmetry of ribs would look really good, but the weird light/shadow relationship still bugs me.', '2010-02-17 14:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
