(5877838, 854119, 108580, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why you rotated this as it''s not the way nature made it, however it''s sharp and the basic monotones are appealing in an abstract way.</td>', 'I''m not sure why you rotated this as it''s not the way nature made it, however it''s sharp and the basic monotones are appealing in an abstract way.', '2010-02-23 14:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
